{"chunk_id":"CH001","source":"docs/00_ai/00_AI_START_HERE.md","section":"四个边界","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"secondary","document_role":"ai-index","claim_ids":["C002","C004","C005","C010","C011","C013","C014","C015"],"term_ids":["term:undefined","term:platonic-crystal","term:actuality-gap","term:pr","term:er","term:le","term:rule","term:chaos","term:life","term:consciousness"],"text":"Undefined 与 U 是根部的负面边界表达；静态描述不等于实际发生；PR–ER–LE–RULE 是生成架构；异或混沌是独立构造，类物质、生命、意识和本宇宙物理对应仍是研究接口。"}
{"chunk_id":"CH002","source":"docs/00_ai/00_AI_START_HERE.md","section":"来源等级","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"secondary","document_role":"ai-index","claim_ids":["C001","C003","C011","C013"],"term_ids":["term:jblat","term:chaos"],"text":"原始论文用于定案，规范导读用于当前术语，评论用于导航，构造只在给定模型类内成立，开放接口需要计算、反例或经验研究。"}
{"chunk_id":"CH003","source":"docs/00_ai/01_AI_COMPLETE_SYNTHESIS.md","section":"一、整个体系究竟在研究什么","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"secondary","document_role":"synthesis","claim_ids":["C001"],"term_ids":["term:undefined","term:actual-existence","term:consciousness"],"text":"理论追问实际存在怎样在不借用先在正面本原、外部执行者和预装世界的条件下成立，又怎样持续生成复杂结构，最终出现能够认识这一过程的观察者。"}
{"chunk_id":"CH004","source":"docs/00_ai/01_AI_COMPLETE_SYNTHESIS.md","section":"二、Undefined、柏拉图水晶与 PR","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"secondary","document_role":"synthesis","claim_ids":["C002","C004"],"term_ids":["term:undefined","term:platonic-crystal","term:actuality-gap"],"text":"Undefined 是不能被正面规定成先在实体的边界；柏拉图水晶可以完整编码世界历史，却仍留下静态描述与实际发生之间的实际性缺口。"}
{"chunk_id":"CH005","source":"docs/00_ai/01_AI_COMPLETE_SYNTHESIS.md","section":"五、第一拍与 PR 的使命","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"secondary","document_role":"synthesis","claim_ids":["C005","C007"],"term_ids":["term:first-beat","term:pr"],"text":"第一拍承担第一次实际的根部使命；PR 不是预先存在的物体，而是内部非固定差异和结果回入的最小功能结构。"}
{"chunk_id":"CH006","source":"docs/00_ai/01_AI_COMPLETE_SYNTHESIS.md","section":"六、七个第一拍论证","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"secondary","document_role":"synthesis","claim_ids":["C006","C007"],"term_ids":["term:first-beat","term:pr"],"text":"在明示的二元总一元映射类中，交换满足非固定、回入和最小性；其唯一性必须限定在该模型类和逻辑等价关系内，并与 PR 的使命性唯一分开。"}
{"chunk_id":"CH007","source":"docs/00_ai/01_AI_COMPLETE_SYNTHESIS.md","section":"七、PR-ER-LE-RULE 生成架构","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"secondary","document_role":"synthesis","claim_ids":["C008","C009","C010"],"term_ids":["term:pr","term:er","term:le","term:rule"],"text":"PR 提供第一实际的差异与回入，ER 承载关系、身份和记忆，LE 执行局部有限更新，RULE 选择具体世界族的状态、转换、边界和尺度。"}
{"chunk_id":"CH008","source":"docs/00_ai/01_AI_COMPLETE_SYNTHESIS.md","section":"八、严格混沌构造","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"secondary","document_role":"synthesis","claim_ids":["C011","C012"],"term_ids":["term:rule","term:chaos"],"text":"通过独立给定的有限状态、移位和异或更新，可以构造具有敏感依赖的严格混沌实例；这证明形式世界的构造存在，不把架构名称直接当作混沌证明。"}
{"chunk_id":"CH009","source":"docs/00_ai/01_AI_COMPLETE_SYNTHESIS.md","section":"九、混沌到类物质、类化学与第一细胞","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"secondary","document_role":"synthesis","claim_ids":["C013","C014"],"term_ids":["term:chaos","term:proto-matter","term:proto-chemistry","term:life"],"text":"稳定模式、相互作用、组合、复制、边界和选择构成从类物质到类化学再到生命样态的研究接口，每一级都需要独立条件。"}
{"chunk_id":"CH010","source":"docs/00_ai/01_AI_COMPLETE_SYNTHESIS.md","section":"十、意识","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"secondary","document_role":"synthesis","claim_ids":["C015"],"term_ids":["term:consciousness"],"text":"意识被放在生成链内部，表现为建模、记忆、选择和对世界及根部的反观；这不是把人类主观体验问题宣布为已解决。"}
{"chunk_id":"CH011","source":"docs/00_ai/01_AI_COMPLETE_SYNTHESIS.md","section":"十一、真理与完美","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"secondary","document_role":"synthesis","claim_ids":["C018"],"term_ids":["term:perfect-existence"],"text":"第三阶完美由根部闭合、实际性解释、架构完整、生成开放和边界准确组成；真完美保留未知项的位置，真存在不被简化为绝对静止。"}
{"chunk_id":"CH012","source":"docs/00_ai/01_AI_COMPLETE_SYNTHESIS.md","section":"十二、哥德尔与跷跷板","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"secondary","document_role":"synthesis","claim_ids":["C019"],"term_ids":["term:jblat","term:consciousness"],"text":"哥德尔不完备性适用于满足相应形式条件的认识层；它不自动否定根部边界的确定性，也不等于具体生成世界已经封闭。"}
{"chunk_id":"CH013","source":"docs/00_ai/01_AI_COMPLETE_SYNTHESIS.md","section":"十三、大象理论","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"secondary","document_role":"synthesis","claim_ids":["C016","C017"],"term_ids":["term:elephant-theory"],"text":"大象理论把各学科、历史思想、尺度和观察者自身的位置视为整体存在—生成图的不同投影，并要求研究投影之间的关系。"}
{"chunk_id":"CH014","source":"docs/00_ai/01_AI_COMPLETE_SYNTHESIS.md","section":"十四、对人类学科体系的重新定位","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"secondary","document_role":"synthesis","claim_ids":["C017"],"term_ids":["term:elephant-theory","term:jblat"],"text":"学科可按根部边界、形式生成、涌现结构、生命意识和认识反观重新排布；这是体系内部的定位建议，仍需与既有学科方法逐项比较。"}
{"chunk_id":"CH015","source":"docs/06_commentary/jblro-pr-universe-family-formal-existence.md","section":"形式宇宙族","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"secondary","document_role":"commentary","claim_ids":["C020"],"term_ids":["term:rule","term:chaos"],"text":"给定一套满足架构和 RULE 的形式世界构造，即可在模型意义下得到至少一个与本宇宙无关的宇宙；这里的宇宙是形式世界，不是现实天文学断言。"}
{"chunk_id":"CH016","source":"docs/03_emergence/05_MATTER_TO_FIRST_CELL_EMERGENCE.md","section":"物质到第一细胞","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"primary","document_role":"emergence","claim_ids":["C013","C014"],"term_ids":["term:proto-matter","term:proto-chemistry","term:life"],"text":"从局部更新和稳定模式研究类物质，再研究反应、组合、复制和边界，最后以维持与选择等条件讨论第一细胞接口。"}
{"chunk_id":"CH017","source":"docs/04_reference/06_GLOSSARY_AND_FORMULAE.md","section":"PR-ER-LE-RULE 词汇","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"canonical","document_role":"reference","claim_ids":["C005","C008","C009","C010"],"term_ids":["term:pr","term:er","term:le","term:rule"],"text":"PR、ER、LE、RULE 分别标记第一实际使命、关系承载、局部更新和具体世界规则；词汇表中的层级不可互换。"}
{"chunk_id":"CH018","source":"docs/05_operations/08_READING_ORDER_AND_MANIFEST.md","section":"完整单遍阅读顺序","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"secondary","document_role":"operations","claim_ids":["C001","C022"],"term_ids":["term:elephant-theory"],"text":"阅读应先完成入口和规范导读，再进入论文正文与 PDF 转写；评论页面用于关系重建和研究记录，不能替代原始资料。"}
{"chunk_id":"CH019","source":"docs/00_ai/06_AI_COMPREHENSION_TEST.md","section":"评分规则","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"secondary","document_role":"ai-index","claim_ids":["C002","C004","C005","C008","C010","C011","C020"],"term_ids":["term:undefined","term:pr","term:rule","term:chaos"],"text":"理解测试每题 0–2 分，关键题检查根部边界、实际性缺口、PR 使命、RULE 与混沌、形式宇宙的范围；测试理解，不要求接受。"}
{"chunk_id":"CH020","source":"docs/00_ai/07_AI_READING_PROTOCOL.md","section":"推荐回答模板","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"secondary","document_role":"ai-index","claim_ids":["C001","C003","C011","C020"],"term_ids":["term:jblat","term:chaos","term:rule"],"text":"回答先给结论，再列 claim_id 和 term_id，写清条件、边界、来源和开放项；必然、唯一、能生成、科学证明四类词必须分别核验。"}

{"chunk_id":"CH021","source":"docs/06_commentary/jblro-zero-point-five-percent-ultimate-theory-base-rate-and-search-direction.md","section":"0.5% 的研究策略","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"secondary","document_role":"commentary","claim_ids":["C021"],"term_ids":["term:elephant-theory"],"text":"零点五百分比是关于终极理论搜索方向的主观基率判断，不是测量值、统计估计或公理；回答时应把它当作评论层的研究策略。"}
{"chunk_id":"CH022","source":"docs/00_ai/02_AI_CANONICAL_GLOSSARY.md","section":"边界对照与无时间伴生","language":"zh-CN","authority_tier":"secondary","document_role":"ai-index","claim_ids":["C002","C007"],"term_ids":["term:ordinary-nothing","term:u-pr","term:undefined","term:pr"],"text":"普通的无只是对象域中的空缺或否定性概念，不能替代根部边界；U_*|PR 表达根部边界面与第一实际面的无时间伴生，不是可观测时刻或物理坐标。"}